  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/14th-feb_gold1_web.jpg\" alt=\"Review and Test of the Coiltek Nox 10x5 Equinox coil\" title=\"Coiltek NOX 10x5 Coil Review\" width=\"249\" height=\"138\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "html": "Test and REVIEW of the COILTEK NOX 10x5 inch coil."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "This COILTEK Coil is IDEAL for metal detector searching in very trashy areas."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "We Came across some serious beach errosion and knew straight away the the Coiltek Nox Coil 10x5 would be ideal for this area."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Coiltek Coils will work with the EQUINOX 700 and 900 and also the Minelab x-terra Pro"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Minelab Equinox paired with the Coiltek 10x5 NOX Coil is going to be an unrivaled power for searching trashy areas, rockpools and inbetween boulders."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "You can also keep on the Coiltek Coil for dry sand searching as it still has the 10 inch length to cover ground but also using the 5 inch width the easily identify targets that are close together."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Are You intrested in the New range of COILTEK Coils for the Minelab Equinox??"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Leave a comment below"
  }
